    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Hello. I’m Noema’s friend from high school.",
        "zh": "你们好，我是沈梦之高中时的朋友。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "She said she’d wait for me here. Do you know where she went?",
        "zh": "她之前说会在这里等我，你们知道她去哪里了吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Lady",
        "zh": "放松的女人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Why did you take so long? It’s already been an hour. “Douqiao” is probably halfway through by now, isn’t it?",
        "zh": "你怎么去了这么久？都已经过了一个小时了。“斗巧”都已经进行到一半了吧？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Short Guy",
        "zh": "矮个的男人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yeah. The Sect Master waited for you for a long time.",
        "zh": "是啊，家主刚才等了你好久来着。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Lady",
        "zh": "放松的女人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "The Elysium Troupe’s performance is almost over. Next it’ll be our turn— the Sect Master went over not long ago to get ready.",
        "zh": "极乐戏团那边已经快结束表演了，接下来就轮到我们这边，家主前不久过去准备了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(Douqiao… I think I’ve heard of it before.)",
        "zh": "（斗巧?之前好像也听说过。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Excuse me—what is “Douqiao”?",
        "zh": "请问“斗巧”指的是？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Lady",
        "zh": "放松的女人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "The Sect Master didn’t tell you? Every time the Yuntai Festival comes around, large groups can sign up to join Douqiao. Our local sect participates every year.",
        "zh": "家主没有告诉你吗？每次芸台大会，大型团体都可以报名参与‘斗巧’，我们本地教派每年都会参加。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Lady",
        "zh": "放松的女人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Basically, you perform on the stage on the street to the right. Every audience member gets a vote, and whoever gets the most votes can go to Jinlan Pavilion to claim a prize.",
        "zh": "本质上就是去右侧那边街道的戏台上表演，所有观众都有投票权，得票最高者可以去金兰观领取奖品。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Guy",
        "zh": "放松的男人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "This year, besides us, those bizarre lunatics from the Elysium Troupe joined too.",
        "zh": "今年除了我们以外，那群极乐戏团的古怪疯子也参加了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Short Guy",
        "zh": "矮个的男人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Shh! Keep your voice down… those people are seriously twisted. And yet something about their presence feels… familiar.",
        "zh": "嘘！小声点......那些家伙邪性的很，身上的气息却总叫人觉着熟悉。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Short Guy",
        "zh": "矮个的男人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "If you’re looking for the Sect Master, head right to the stage. You should still catch her just in time for her performance.",
        "zh": "你要找家主，就向右走去戏台那里吧。应该能正好赶上她上台表演。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Got it. Thank you so much.",
        "zh": "我知道了，非常感谢。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Guy",
        "zh": "放松的男人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh—every year’s performance has an interactive part. If you want, you can give it a try.",
        "zh": "对了，每年的表演都有互动内容，你要是想，可以去试试。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": {
        "en": "Relax Lady",
        "zh": "放松的女人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
